index=entra sourcetype="azure:loganalytics:securityevent" EventID=4769 earliest=-1h latest=now
``` ========================================================================== ```
``` Detection (SPL): Kerberoasting - RC4 service tickets for user SPNs         ```
``` Lab:             Contoso Health Identity Platform - Splunk second SIEM     ```
``` KQL twin:        lab/kql/kerberoast-rc4-service-ticket.kql                 ```
``` -------------------------------------------------------------------------- ```
``` STAND-IN: Splunk Enterprise 60-day TRIAL over SecurityEvent REPLAYED from  ```
``` Log Analytics (ingest-from-loganalytics.sh -T SecurityEvent).              ```
```                                                                            ```
``` WHAT IT CATCHES                                                            ```
```   4769 on DC01, TicketEncryptionType 0x17 (RC4), Status 0x0, service a     ```
```   user account (not NAME$, not krbtgt). High for 3+ services per           ```
```   requester (a sweep) or a Tier-0 SPN account (svc-legacy-da),             ```
```   else Medium.                                                             ```
``` MITRE ATT&CK: T1558.003 Kerberoasting.                                     ```
```                                                                            ```
``` KQL -> SPL TRANSLATION                                                     ```
```   summarize dcount(Service) by Requester -> stats dc(Service) BY Requester ```
```   set_intersect(Services, Tier0Spn)     -> mvfind on the values() list     ```
```   TicketEncryptionType is not a SecurityEvent column (Microsoft Learn):    ```
```   KQL extract() from EventData  -> rex field=EventData                     ```
```                                                                            ```
``` SCHEDULE: PT5M / PT1H, severity from the Severity column, throttled 1 h    ```
``` per Account + Severity.                                                    ```
``` ========================================================================== ```
``` @stanza Contoso - Kerberoasting RC4 service tickets ```
``` @conf description = RC4 (0x17) Kerberos service tickets for user-account SPNs on DC01: offline-crackable; High for a sweep or a Tier-0 SPN. KQL twin: lab/kql/kerberoast-rc4-service-ticket.kql ```
``` @conf disabled = 0 ```
``` @conf enableSched = 1 ```
``` @conf cron_schedule = */5 * * * * ```
``` @conf dispatch.earliest_time = -1h ```
``` @conf dispatch.latest_time = now ```
``` @conf counttype = number of events ```
``` @conf relation = greater than ```
``` @conf quantity = 0 ```
``` @conf alert.track = 1 ```
``` @conf alert.severity = 5 ```
``` @conf alert.expires = 7d ```
``` @conf alert.digest_mode = 0 ```
``` @conf alert.suppress = 1 ```
``` @conf alert.suppress.fields = Account,Severity ```
``` @conf alert.suppress.period = 1h ```
``` @conf request.ui_dispatch_app = search ```
``` @conf request.ui_dispatch_view = search ```
| where EventID==4769
| eval Host=upper(mvindex(split(coalesce(Computer, ""), "."), 0))
| rex field=EventData "Name=\"TicketEncryptionType\">(?<TicketEncryptionType>[^<]+)<"
| where in(Host, "DC01") AND lower(coalesce(TicketEncryptionType, ""))=="0x17" AND lower(coalesce(Status, ""))=="0x0"
| eval Service=lower(ServiceName)
| where NOT match(coalesce(Service, ""), "[$]$") AND NOT match(coalesce(Service, ""), "^krbtgt")
| eval Requester=lower(mvindex(split(coalesce(TargetUserName, ""), "@"), 0)), RequesterRealm=mvindex(split(coalesce(TargetUserName, ""), "@"), 1)
| where NOT match(Requester, "[$]$")
| eval SourceIp=replace(coalesce(IpAddress, ""), "^::ffff:", "")
| stats max(_time) AS LastEpoch, min(_time) AS FirstEpoch, values(Service) AS Services, dc(Service) AS ServiceCount, count AS Tickets, values(SourceIp) AS SourceIps BY Requester RequesterRealm Host
| eval Tier0Roasted=if(isnotnull(mvfind(Services, "^svc-legacy-da$")), "true", "false")
| eval Account=Requester, AccountDomain=RequesterRealm, SourceIp=mvindex(SourceIps, 0)
| eval Severity=if(ServiceCount>=3 OR Tier0Roasted=="true", "High", "Medium")
| eval _time=LastEpoch, TimeGenerated=strftime(LastEpoch, "%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S.%3N%z"), FirstSeen=strftime(FirstEpoch, "%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S.%3N%z")
| sort 0 - _time
| table TimeGenerated, Severity, Account, AccountDomain, Host, SourceIp, SourceIps, ServiceCount, Services, Tier0Roasted, Tickets, FirstSeen
